<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Company purchased approximately <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20260401__20260630__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--OneThirdPartyVendorMember_zJxIOBiLc3Hf" title="Concentration percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_OneThirdPartyVendorMember" id="Fact000736" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">90</ix:nonFraction></span>% of its materials from one third-party vendor. For the
three months ended June 30, 2025, the Company purchased approximately <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250401__20250630__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--TwoThirdPartyVendorsMember_zNj3aqB7jtz1" title="Concentration percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-04-012025-06-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_TwoThirdPartyVendorsMember" id="Fact000738" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">89</ix:nonFraction></span>% of its materials from two third-party vendors, with these vendors
representing <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250401__20250630__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--OneThirdPartyVendorMember_zngkATnhIZkl" title="Concentration percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-04-012025-06-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_OneThirdPartyVendorMember" id="Fact000740" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">56</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250401__20250630__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--TwoThirdPartyVendorMember_zOb0Wijw2Kr8" title="Concentration percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-04-012025-06-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_TwoThirdPartyVendorMember" id="Fact000742" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">33</ix:nonFraction></span>%, respectively.</span></p>

