vesting terms of the options issued under the 2021 BC Plan are generally <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1_dc_c20260401__20260630__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneBeyondCancerLtdEquityIncentivePlanMember_zPdis1NCshS" title="Vesting period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneBeyondCancerLtdEquityIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="Fact000876" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1">four years</ix:nonNumeric></span> and they expire <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod_dc_c20260401__20260630__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneBeyondCancerLtdEquityIncentivePlanMember_z2dIu5PM2EMf" title="Expiration period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneBeyondCancerLtdEquityIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="Fact000878" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod">ten years</ix:nonNumeric></span> from the grant date. On
November 3, 2022, the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors approved an amendment to reserve for issuance an additional <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized_pid_c20221103__20221103__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneBeyondCancerLtdEquityIncentivePlanMember_zupVRK0vjG6c" title="Number of additionl shares reserve for issuance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" contextRef="From2022-11-032022-11-03_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneBeyondCancerLtdEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact000880" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares
