balance of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20241101__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember_zegyxpS3n368" title="Principal amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-01_custom_LoanAndSecurityAgreementMember" id="Fact001259" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">11.5</ix:nonFraction></span>
million. The Loan Agreement was approved by each of the Company&#8217;s independent and disinterested directors, following the
