at the rate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateDuringPeriod_pid_dp_c20251104__20251104__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--NotePurchaseAgreementMember_zcX6kHaOI9jb" title="Debt instrument, interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateDuringPeriod" contextRef="From2025-11-042025-11-04_custom_NotePurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001295" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">15</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum, with no interest accruing for the first 12 months following issuance; provided however, that Streeterville
