<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">During
the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Company and Streeterville entered into various exchange agreements, pursuant to which the Company
delivered to Streeterville <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20260401__20260630__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--StreetervilleCapitalLLCMember_zYdnpGVOoFYj" title="Shares issued of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30_custom_StreetervilleCapitalLLCMember" id="Fact001303" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">58,692</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock at an average price of $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20260630__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--StreetervilleCapitalLLCMember_zHsiQhObmxF7" title="Share price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_StreetervilleCapitalLLCMember" id="Fact001305" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">8.52</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, as adjusted for the 2026 Reverse Stock Split, based on the average closing stock
